{
  "metaDescription": "Heroplan — all-language hero database for Empires & Puzzles: every hero's stats, skills and portraits in 20 in-game languages, plus upcoming heroes and simulators.",
  "seoHeading": "Empires &amp; Puzzles Hero Database · All-Language Data · Portraits · Upcoming Heroes · Player Toolkit",
  "seoPara1": "<strong>Heroplan</strong> covers <strong>every hero</strong> in Empires &amp; Puzzles and <strong>fully supports all 20 in-game languages</strong> — 简体中文, 繁體中文, English, 日本語, 한국어, Français, Deutsch, Español, Português, Italiano, Русский, العربية, Türkçe, Polski, Nederlands, Svenska, Dansk, Norsk, Suomi and Indonesia. Switch language to read hero names, special skills and passive abilities in your own tongue. Every hero lists rarity, element, mana speed, class, family, origin and costumes, plus attack, defense, health and power at level 80 / LB1 / LB2. All hero data is parsed from the game's <strong>official configuration files</strong>.",
  "seoPara2": "The site offers a <strong>complete hero portrait gallery</strong>: open any hero to see a high-resolution static portrait, and watch the in-game <strong>animated hero art</strong> for supported characters. <strong>Upcoming hero preview</strong> lists not-yet-released heroes by official release date so you can plan resources ahead (favoriting unlocks when the hero goes live). For search, beyond name, rarity, element, mana speed, class, family and origin, you can run compound queries over <strong>special skill text</strong>, <strong>passive skill text</strong> and skill categories; the <strong>stat calculator</strong> instantly converts exact values across limit breaks (LB1/LB2) and talents (+20/+25).",
  "seoPara3": "Beyond the database, a set of tools is built in: the <strong>summon simulator</strong> reproduces pool odds and summon history; the <strong>team simulator</strong> builds line-ups you can share with your alliance; the <strong>chat simulator</strong> creates chat text with custom colours and in-game emojis; the <strong>farming guide</strong> and <strong>wanted mission</strong> tables pinpoint drop stages fast; the <strong>event calendar</strong> and <strong>redeem codes</strong> keep you on top of limited-time content. Save favourite heroes and share the list by link, export or import your setup, and pick a light or dark theme.",
  "pageTitle": "Empires & Puzzles Hero Database | All Heroes, Portraits & Upcoming | Heroplan",
